    "created_at": "2020-06-20T11:47:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-20T11:47:51Z",
    "body": "Hi, there. Long time since the last update. There are two changes since my last reply.\r\n\r\n1. As is mentioned by @rochdev , I've opened a PR #1085 in which you could disable the *slow* part of the git_status module.\r\n\r\n2. Another work is done by the owner matchai in https://github.com/matchai/starship-poc . He has done a full rewrite on how starship handles git status.\r\n\r\n@AndrewGaspar Thanks for your idea. In starship, we use `libgit` instead of the git binary to get the results, but `libgit` is much slower than `git status`. This will be fixed by matchai's work I mentioned above in 2.",
